                    Spreadsheet workbooks that stay inspectable —<br />from data to export.
                </h1>
                <p class="hero__sub">
                    One workbook model for reading, formula inspection, pivot
                    summaries and export. Agents work with real sheets and
                    formula cells, not screenshots of a grid, so every change
                    stays addressable and reversible.
                </p>
                <div class="hero__cta">
                    <Link to="FeaturesPage" class="btn btn--primary">
